    "Id": "chassisdef_zeus_ZEU-P-X",
    "Name": "Zeus",
    "Details": "The Zeus ZEU-P-X is a prototype version of the Zeus that would eventually be further developed into the Zeus X. It mounts the same LBX AC/20, MRM-30 and two ER Medium Lasers as the eventual Zeus X ZEU-X, but uses a standard chassis and has considerably less armor. However, the ZEU-X-P mounts a C3 Slave computer, something the ZEU-X is lacking.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Barrel Fist</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.14</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limits: Left Lower, Right Lower</color>",
